OL,3,AParents' concerns to trigger urgent
OL,4,Achecks in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new early warning system is being
OL,7,Fintroduced in hospital emergency
OL,8,Fdepartments in England to help busy NHS
OL,9,Fstaff identify sick children who are
OL,10,Fdangerously deteriorating.
OL,12,FA high overall score means a child
OL,13,Fneeds more urgent attention. Concerns
OL,14,Ffrom staff, parents, carers or the
OL,15,Fchild themselves will trigger an
OL,16,Fimmediate escalation of care.
OL,18,FIt comes after Health Secretary Yvette
OL,19,FCooper promised to stop "corridor care"
OL,20,Ffor sick children because of long waits
OL,21,Ffor hospital beds.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
