OL,3,AIran killed her teenage daughter - now
OL,4,Ashe is facing up to the regime
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut that all changed the day her only
OL,7,Fchild was shot dead in front of her by
OL,8,FIranian security forces.
OL,9,FSixteen-year-old Sevda was taking part
OL,10,Fin protests against Iran's repressive
OL,11,Fregime that engulfed the country
OL,12,Fearlier this year - before the US and
OL,13,FIsrael launched widespread air strikes
OL,14,Fwhich killed the country's supreme
OL,15,Fleader Ayatollah Ali Khamenei.
