OL,3,AShop freezers in six European countries
OL,4,Ahit by suspected cyber-attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of supermarkets across six
OL,7,FEuropean countries have been hit by a
OL,8,Fsuspected cyber-attack affecting their
OL,9,Frefrigerators and freezers.
OL,11,FAround 40 Delhaize supermarkets in
OL,12,FBelgium and Luxembourg were affected,
OL,13,Fwhile a smaller number of shops were
OL,14,Fhit in Sweden, Ireland, the Netherlands
OL,15,Fand Estonia.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
