OL,3,ARow in Michigan over Democrat's shock
OL,4,Aendorsement of Republican as US midterm
OL,5,Acampaigns enter last day
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the final day of campaigning in
OL,8,Fthe US midterm elections, where voters
OL,9,Fwill decide which party controls
OL,10,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fpresidency
OL,13,FA row has erupted in the Democratic
OL,14,FParty after Michigan congresswoman
OL,15,FHaley Stevens, who missed out on the
OL,16,Fparty's Senate nomination in the state
OL,17,Fto Abdul El-Sayed, endorsed Republican
OL,18,Frival Mike Rogers
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
